 menu.thanks for all the support. keep playing and giving feedback!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T08:29:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706694211","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4331960-1846018067941430","game_id":"steam-4331960","kind":"update","title":"October Update, Demo is Ready For Next Fest!","summary":"Spectral Map is almost here! Here is an outline of recent changes and fixes players can expect for the demo release.Additions:New tutorial area with a new track, the Plasticine Membrane! Here players can get an understanding of the nonconventional movement and control system. Complete with helpful NPCs and video loops!Added dynamic ambience to audio system. Different areas will have their own ambience, and will adapt to your location accordingly. The wave sounds grow louder as you near the surfa","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T15:55:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067941430","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4331960":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:07:44Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:07:43Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4331960":"2026-10-26T12:07:44Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4331960":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:07:43Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:07:43Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:07:43Z"},"4804930":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:07:44Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:07:44Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:07:44Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id